# No Cursor browser testing

Never open, navigate, click, screenshot, or lock the Cursor IDE browser (cursor-ide-browser MCP) to test this app.

Verify with unit tests, curl against a running server, SQL, or logs. If a visual check is needed, tell the user to look in their own browser.
